    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "After I hung up the phone, I heard the Capitol Police saying evacuate, get out of here, get out of here. And not knowing what was taking place, no one did. We just asked where to go, where to go, and the police officer just pointed toward the Supreme Court and just said, run down the street, run down the street.",
