        "text": "The legislative process requires formal votes on major bills like the AUMF.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Congressional attendance at critical votes is expected and significant.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Taking a deep breath indicates emotional preparation or personal significance of the act.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The timing of the vote relative to a religious service has symbolic or moral weight.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
